"entity": {
"name": "Lighthouse Properties Plc",
"description": "Lighthouse Properties Plc engages in the investment activities which focus in the field of real estate and infrastructure. It operates through the following segments: Listed Infrastructure, Listed Real Estate, Direct Property, and Corporate. The Listed Infrastructure segment engages in the investments in liquid listed infrastructure securities on recognized exchanges, utilizing both cash investments and equity swap derivatives. The Listed Real Estate segment engages in the investments in liquid listed real estate securities on recognized exchanges, utilizing both cash investments and equity swap derivatives. The Direct Property segment engages in the investments in direct commercial properties in the retail sector, opportunistic acquisitions in the retail, logistics, industrial, warehousing and office sectors are also considered. The company was founded on August 14, 2014 and is headquartered in Sliema, Malta.",
